<title>ITALY: Italian Dec BTP on LIFFE forges new historic high.</title>
<headline>Italian Dec BTP on LIFFE forges new historic high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The December Btp futures contract on LIFFE forged a new historic high at 124.65, surpassing the 124.37 level reached last month.</p>
<p>By 1133 GMT the contract was 90 basis points higher on the day at 124.60.</p>
